  "summary": "ruby-mechanize vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Mechanize used Kernel#open to open local files in\nseveral methods. If an application passed untrusted input as a local file\nname to one of these methods, an attacker could possibly use this issue to\nexecute arbitrary commands.",
